Output tensor of shape (batch_size, num_classes).\n        \"\"\"\n        x = self.features(x)\n        x = self.classifier(x)\n        return x\n```\n\n### Key Points Followed from Mentor's Guidelines:\n\n- **Naming Conventions**:\n  - Class name: `BinaryImageClassifier` (ends",
